{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;</i>Be Rich Or Good<i>&quot;</i> \u2013 A Commercial Labyrinth of Choices and Redemption</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A conspiracy strips the protagonist Shane of everything, and eight years later, he infiltrates Yongqiang Group under a pseudonym, navigating the whirlpool of power and truth to seek answers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep Interactive Narrative</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make shapes the story\u2019s branching paths, unlocking over 20+ endings and letting you experience drastically different fates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308700/extras/8be17c9d6cf1f70aba1eb55d6eccbc88.avif?t=1759325752\" data-has-big width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308700/extras/65d82a13c754ea6e76f7d80aff543430.avif?t=1759325752\" data-has-big width=1560 height=1040 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308700/extras/\u53d6\u94b1.jpg?t=1759325752\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Workplace Strategic Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrive in the complex web of corporate relationships. Gain critical permissions through dialogues, missions, and decisions to inch closer to the core secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308700/extras/cc7fd00d4a1535c99dec8099be397128.avif?t=1759325752\" data-has-big width=1560 height=1040 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308700/extras/d3dfa71fba6eb0929257b690d8aa96be.avif?t=1759325752\" data-has-big width=1560 height=2340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308700/extras/\u83dc\u5e02\u573a.jpg?t=1759325752\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cinematic Immersive Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic feedback system and meticulously designed character interactions deliver a narrative experience that pulls you into the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308700/extras/20fac8a0b89978565a67df2b3d6fd3ef.avif?t=1759325752\" data-has-big width=1560 height=1040 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308700/extras/36fec74ada47dd1d3e4f14e01c1d1f23.avif?t=1759325752\" data-has-big width=1560 height=1040 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308700/extras/66e11437563553fe3994108164c60400.avif?t=1759325752\" data-has-big width=1560 height=1040 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This immersive journey blends corporate intrigue with moral dilemmas, where your every move determines how Shane\u2019s quest for redemption unfolds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ideal for Players Who Enjoy:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plot-driven storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic decision-making</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploring multiple endings</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3308700?t=1759325752","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamsta